1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:06,020
The coffee's gone cold and the window is gray

2
00:00:08,020 --> 00:00:15,540
The doctors talk softly, then look away

3
00:00:15,540 --> 00:00:21,220
I'm holding your hand, and it's smaller somehow

4
00:00:22,740 --> 00:00:30,420
Than the one that once carried the whole world around

5
00:00:30,420 --> 00:00:34,260
And I know what they see in this room tonight

6
00:00:34,260 --> 00:00:38,100
The worn-out body, the fading light

7
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:41,860
But they weren't around for the half of the ride

8
00:00:41,860 --> 00:00:46,260
They never saw the fire you carried inside
